  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've verified your account, Isaac, and refunded your order to your card.\n\nThe courier's log shows they picked up order K-6401 from Kaze Sushi at 6:25 PM and abandoned it at 7:02 PM. It was never delivered.\n\n**Refund:** $48.99, the full amount you were charged, has gone back to your Visa ending in 4242. It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**About your statement:** You may also see a $48.99 pending hold from when you placed the order. That hold was already cancelled when the charge went through, so it isn't a second charge. It should disappear within 1\u20133 business days.\n\nI'm sorry your dinner didn't arrive. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that's what I wanted. Three to five business days is fine.\n\nCan you tell me why the courier abandoned it, though? Did they say anything, or is it just a note in the app?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I checked, and the courier's log only has a brief system note: \"Courier abandoned the delivery; the order was not delivered.\" It was recorded at 7:02 PM, about 37 minutes after pickup. The log doesn't include any message or reason from the courier, so I can't tell you why they left the delivery.\n\nYour refund isn't affected by this. The $48.99 is on its way to your card either way.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that's fair. I just wanted to know if there was something going on with the courier or the restaurant. Thanks for getting the refund sorted."
