   "text": "I checked Kaze Sushi's record too, and there are no open incidents. The courier's log shows the restaurant had your order ready and handed it over at 6:25 PM. As far as our records show, the problem happened during delivery, not at the restaurant.\n\nYour $48.99 refund is on its way to your Visa ending in 4242. Enjoy the rest of your evening, Isaac. I hope your next order arrives without any trouble."
